reportSummary":"据市场情报机构 Sensor Tower 估计，OpenAI 旗下 ChatGPT 全球月活跃用户在 2025 年 5 月突破 10 亿，成为达成此里程碑最快的应用，增速超过 Google Maps、TikTok 等。同期，其竞争对手 Anthropic 的 Claude 月活达 5600 万，同比增幅约 640%，增长势头迅猛。数据显示，部分用户已开始在 Claude 与 ChatGPT 间切换使用。在达成用户里程碑之际，Anthropic 已秘密递交 IPO 申请，OpenAI 也计划筹备上市。","reportEdition":"2026-06-04","reportKind":"daily"},{"id":"https://aihot.news/items/cmpxlx0y5058eslckymzyv282","title":"消息称 DeepSeek 首轮融资拟筹集 500 亿元，腾讯、宁德时代等参投","topic":"行业","publishedAt":"2026-06-04T00:00:00.452Z","urls":["https://aihot.news/items/cmpxlx0y5058eslckymzyv282","https://www.ithome.com/0/959/249.htm"],"articles":[{"id":"cmpxlx0y5058eslckymzyv282","title":"消息称 DeepSeek 首轮融资拟筹集 500 亿元，腾讯、宁德时代等参投","originalTitle":"","summary":"DeepSeek 计划在首轮融资中从腾讯、宁德时代等投资方处筹集约 500 亿元人民币。融资落地后，其投后估值预计在 3500 亿至 4000 亿元。创始人梁文峰将出资 200 亿元，腾讯和宁德时代分别拟投资 100 亿元和 50 亿元，成为最大外部投资者。DeepSeek 去年凭借 V3 大模型与 R1 推理模型获得广泛认可。此次融资凸显了中国正打造从大模型到算力能源基建的全链条 AI 产业。","reason":"","url":"https://aihot.news/items/cmpxlx0y5058eslckymzyv282","originalUrl":"https://www.ithome.com/0/959/249.htm","publishedAt":"2026-06-04T00:00:00.452Z","sourcePublishedAt":null,"discoveredAt":null,"datePrecision":"report","sourceId":"aihot-23t2ho","originalSourceName":"IT之家·人工智能","family":"outlet-115kagi","kind":"media","provider":"aihot","category":null,"sectionLabel":"行业动态","selected":false,"contentMode":"licensed-summary","contentType":"news","translationStatus":"original","evidenceRole":"discovery","rights":{"licenseId":"LicenseRef-AIHOT-Written-Permission","permissionId":"aihot-mojing-written-2026-11-04","provider":"aihot","scope":"text-summary","evidenceUrl":"https://aihot.news/items/cmpxlx0y5058eslckymzyv282","licenseUrl":"https://aihot.news/terms","checkedAt":"2026-11-13T18:47:49.612Z","attribution":"导读来源：AIHOT；原报道权利归原作者","modified":"保留 AIHOT 原摘要，未二次改写"}}],"familyCount":0,"mergeReasons":[],"selectionReasons":[],"provider":"aihot","sourceStates":[{"id":"aihot-23t2ho","name":"IT之家·人工智能","status":"ok","lastSuccessAt":"2026-11-13T18:47:49.612Z"}],"sectionLa