共同建设。 点击此处阅读Mikey的博客：https://suno.com/blog/series-d-announcement","reportEdition":"2026-06-04","reportKind":"daily"},{"id":"https://aihot.news/items/cmpyhoxxg002qsli30vj99h80","title":"NVIDIA Research 在 CVPR 2026 发表三篇论文：规模化训练实现抓取、自动驾驶与智能体泛化","topic":"研究","publishedAt":"2026-06-04T00:00:00.452Z","urls":["https://aihot.news/items/cmpyhoxxg002qsli30vj99h80","https://blogs.nvidia.com/blog/cvpr-research-grasping-driving-agent-training"],"articles":[{"id":"cmpyhoxxg002qsli30vj99h80","title":"NVIDIA Research 在 CVPR 2026 发表三篇论文：规模化训练实现抓取、自动驾驶与智能体泛化","originalTitle":"","summary":"NVIDIA Research 在 CVPR 2026 上发表三篇论文，展示规模化训练带来的泛化能力。GraspGen-X 是首个零样本抓取基础模型，基于 20 亿次模拟抓取训练，可为任意末端执行器生成抓取姿态。LCDrive 用紧凑潜在表示替代文本推理，让自动驾驶在嵌入式硬件上更快推理。NitroGen 基于 Isaac GR00T 架构，在大量虚拟环境中训练具身智能体。此外还发布了新的物理 AI 智能体技能，以及配合 GraspGen-X 使用的 CUDA 加速运动规划库 curoboV2 和闭环抓取论文 Grasp-MPC。","reason":"","url":"https://aihot.news/items/cmpyhoxxg002qsli30vj99h80","originalUrl":"https://blogs.nvidia.com/blog/cvpr-research-grasping-driving-agent-training","publishedAt":"2026-06-04T00:00:00.452Z","sourcePublishedAt":null,"discoveredAt":null,"datePrecision":"report","sourceId":"aihot-9h3ytl","originalSourceName":"NVIDIA AI Blog","family":"outlet-qhqcno","kind":"media","provider":"aihot","category":null,"sectionLabel":"论文研究","selected":false,"contentMode":"licensed-summary","contentType":"news","translationStatus":"original","evidenceRole":"discovery","rights":{"licenseId":"LicenseRef-AIHOT-Written-Permission","permissionId":"aihot-mojing-written-2026-11-04","provider":"aihot","scope":"text-summary","evidenceUrl":"https://aihot.news/items/cmpyhoxxg002qsli30vj99h80","licenseUrl":"https://aihot.news/terms","checkedAt":"2026-11-13T18:47:49.612Z","attribution":"导读来源：AIHOT；原报道权利归原作者","modified":"保留 AIHOT 原摘要，未二次改写"}}],"familyCount":0,"mergeReasons":[],"selectionReasons":[],"provider":"aihot","sourceStates":[{"id":"aihot-9h3ytl","name":"NVIDIA AI Blog","status":"ok","lastSuccessAt":"2026-11-13T18:47:49.612Z"}],"sectionLabel":"论文研究","reportSummary":"NVIDIA Research 在 CVPR 2026 上发表三篇论文，展示规模化训练带来的泛化能力。GraspGen-X 是首个零样本抓取基础模型，基于 20 亿次模拟抓取训练，可为任意末端执行器生成抓取姿态。LCDrive 用紧凑潜在表示替代文本推理，让自动驾驶在嵌入式硬件上更快推理。NitroGen 基于 Isaac GR00T 架构，在大量虚拟环境中训练具身智能体。此外还发布了新的物理 AI 智能体技能，以及配合 GraspGen-X 使用的 CUDA 加速运动规划库 curoboV2 和闭环抓取论文 Grasp-MPC。","reportEdition":"2026-06-04","reportKind":"daily"},{"id":"https://aihot.news/items/cmpxvzm7o00jqsliwbt1hnvae","title":"Anthropic 分析 832 个 AI 恶意账户：中高风险攻击者半年从 33% 跃至 56%","topic":"研究","publishedAt":"2026-06-04T00:00:00.452Z","urls":["https://aihot.news/items/cmpxvzm7o00jqsliwbt1hnvae","https://www.anthropic.com/news/AI-enabled-cyber-threats-mitre-attack"],"articles":[{"id":"cmpxvzm7o00jqsliwbt1hnvae","title":"Anthropic 分析 832 个 AI 恶意账户：中高风险攻击者半年从 33% 跃至 56%","originalTitle":"","summary":"Anthropic 分析 2025 年 3 月至 2026 年 3 月间 832 个被封禁的恶意账户，映射至 MITRE ATT&CK 框架。67.3% 使用 AI 编写恶意软件，6.5% 用于横向移动。六个月间中高风险攻击者占比从 33% 升至 56%。AI 用于账户发现增长 8.9%，AI 辅助钓鱼下降 8.6%。传统基于技术数量或平台（Claude Code、API、聊天界面）的威胁评估失效，而 MITRE ATT&CK 框架尚未收录此类智能体编排行为。","reason":"","url":"https://aihot.news/items/cmpxvzm7o00jqsliwbt1hnvae","originalUrl":"https://www.anthropic.com/news/AI-enabled-cyber-threats-mitre-attack","publishedAt":"2026-06-04T00:00:00.452Z","sourcePublishedAt":null,"discoveredAt":null,"datePrecision":"report","sourceId":"aihot-14mqazp","originalSourceName":"Anthropic：Research（发表成果 · 网页）","family":"anthropic","kind":"official","provider":"aihot","category":null,"sectionLabel":"论文研究","selected":false,"contentMode":"licensed-summary","contentType":"news","translationStatus":"original","evidenceRole":"discovery","rights":{"licenseId":"LicenseRef-AIHOT-Written-Permission","permissionId":"aihot-mojing-written-2026-11-04","provider":"aihot","scope":"text-summary","evidenceUrl":"https://aihot.news/items/cmpxvzm7o00jqsliwbt1hnvae","licenseUrl":"https://aihot.news/terms","checkedAt":"2026-11-13T18:47:49.612Z","attribution":"导读来源：AIHOT；原报道权利归原作者","modified":"保留 AIHOT 原摘要，未二次改写"}}],"familyCount":0,"mergeReasons":[],"selectionReasons":[],"provider":"aihot","sourceStates":[{"id":"aihot-14mqazp","name":"Anthropic：Research（发表成果 · 网页）","status":"ok","lastSuccessAt":"2026-11-13T18:47:49.612Z"}],"sectionLabel":"论文研究","reportSummary":"Anthropic 分析 2025 年 3 月至 2026 年 3 月间 832 个被封禁的恶意账户，映射至 MITRE ATT&CK 框架。67.3% 使用 AI 编写恶意软件，6.5% 用于横向移动。六个月间中高风险攻击者占比从 33% 升至 56%。AI 用于账户发现增长 8.9%，AI 辅助钓鱼下降 8.6%。传统基于技术数量或平台（Claude Code、API、聊天界面）的威胁评估失效，而 MITRE ATT&CK 框架尚未收录此类智能体编排行为。","reportEdition":"2026-06-04","reportKind":"daily"},{"id":"https://aihot.news/items/cmpyacsh5038rslaxlh6udycy","title":"微软研究：装瓶厂AI从聊天到决策","topic":"研究","publishedAt":"2026-06-04T00:00:00.452Z","urls":["https://aihot.news/items/cmpyacsh5038rslaxlh6udycy","https://x.com/MSFTResearch/status/2062204914223169635"],"articles":[{"id":"cmpyacsh5038rslaxlh6udycy","title":"微软研究：装瓶厂AI从聊天到决策","originalTitle":"","summary":"一份在中西部装瓶厂进行的三个月试点显示，当AI超越聊天进入决策领域时会发生什么——约束条件变化、风险真实、答案必须可靠。 https://msft.it/6015vjYUN","reason":"","url":"https://aihot.news/items/cmpyacsh5038rslaxlh6udycy","originalUrl":"https://x.com/MSFTResearch/status/2062204914223169635","publishedAt":"2026-06-04T00:00:00.452Z","sourcePublishedAt":null,"discoveredAt":null,"datePrecision":"report","sourceId":"aihot-1mdp1f","originalSourceName":"X：Microsoft Research (@MSFTResearch)","family":"outlet-1d9q3z8","kind":"community","provider":"aihot","category":null,"sectionLabel":"论文研究","selected":false,"contentMode":"licensed-summary","contentType":"news","translationStatus":"original","evidenceRole":"discovery","rights":{"licenseId":"LicenseRef-AIHOT-Written-Permission","permissionId":"aihot-mojing-written-2026-11-04","provider":"aihot","scope":"text-summary","evidenceUrl":"https://aihot.news/items/cmpyacsh5038rslaxlh6udycy","licenseUrl":"https://aihot.news/terms","checkedAt":"2026-11-13T18:47:49.612Z","attribution":"导读来源：AIHOT；原报道权利归原作者","modified":"保留 AIHOT 原摘要，未二次改写"}}],"familyCount":0,"mergeReasons":[],"selectionReasons":[],"provider":"aihot","sourceStates":[{"id":"aihot-1mdp1f","name":"X：Microsoft Research (@MSFTResearch)","status":"ok","lastSuccessAt":"2026-11-13T18:47:49.612Z"}],"sectionLabel":"论文研究","reportSummary":"一份在中西部装瓶厂进行的三个月试点显示，当AI超越聊天进入决策领域时会发生什么——约束条件变化、风险真实、答案必须可靠。 https://msft.it/6015vjYUN","reportEdition":"2026-06-04","reportKind":"daily"},{"id":"https://aihot.news/items/cmpygbyx004v6slax1d1lqpuz","title":"世界模型的功能分类","topic":"开发","publishedAt":"2026-06-04T00:00:00.452Z","urls":["https://aihot.news/items/cmpygbyx004v6slax1d1lqpuz","https://x.com/drfeifei/status/2062247238143996275"],"articles":[{"id":"cmpygbyx004v6slax1d1lqpuz","title":"世界模型的功能分类","originalTitle":"","summary":"World Labs团队与李飞飞发文，梳理“世界模型”这一被滥用的术语。对比语言模型学习文本统计，世界模型学习空间与时间统计（如光照、物理规律）。基于部分可观马尔可夫决策过程（POMDP）框架，智能体通过动作影响世界状态，观测是部分视图。当前被称为“世界模型”的不同系统本质上是同一循环的不同投影：第一类为渲染器，输出给人眼看的像素，以视觉保真度为核心。文章着重于概念分层，未给出具体模型名、参数或基准分数。","reason":"","url":"https://aihot.news/items/cmpygbyx004v6slax1d1lqpuz","originalUrl":"https://x.com/drfeifei/status/2062247238143996275","publishedAt":"2026-06-04T00:00:00.452Z","sourcePublishedAt":null,"discoveredAt":null,"datePrecision":"report","sourceId":"aihot-9iflhl","originalSourceName":"X：Fei-Fei Li (@drfeifei, World Labs)","family":"outlet-1w63iue","kind":"community","provider":"aihot","category":null,"sectionLabel":"技巧与观点","selected":false,"contentMode":"licensed-summary","contentType":"news","translationStatus":"original","evidenceRole":"discovery","rights":{"licenseId":"LicenseRef-AIHOT-Written-Permission","permissionId":"aihot-mojing-written-2026-11-04","provider":"aihot","scope":"text-summary","evidenceUrl":"https://aihot.news/items/cmpygbyx004v6slax1d1lqpuz","licenseUrl":"https://aihot.news/terms","checkedAt":"2026-11-13T18:47:49.612Z","attribution":"导读来源：AIHOT；原报道权利归原作者","modified":"保留 AIHOT 原摘要，未二次改写"}}],"familyCount":0,"mergeReasons":[],"selectionReasons":[],"provider":"aihot","sourceStates":[{"id":"aihot-9iflhl","name":"X：Fei-Fei Li (@drfeifei, World Labs)","status":"ok","lastSuccessAt":"2026-11-13T18:47:49.612Z"}],"sectionLabel":"技巧与观点","reportSummary":"World Labs团队与李飞飞发文，梳理“世界模型”这一被滥用的术语。对比语言模型学习文本统计，世界模型学习空间与时间统计（如光照、物理规律）。基于部分可观马尔可夫决策过程（POMDP）框架，智能体通过动作影响世界状态，观测是部分视图。当前被称为“世界模型”的不同系统本质上是同一循环的不同投影：第一类为渲染器，输出给人眼看的像素，以视觉保真度为核心。文章着重于概念分层，未给出具体模型名、参数或基准分数。","reportEdition":"2026-06-04","reportKind":"daily"},{"id":"https://aihot.news/items/cmpyc4uab03qgslaxgjm4awp6","title":"Anthropic 用 Claude 赋能自助数据分析","topic":"开发","publishedAt":"2026-06-04T00:00:00.452Z","urls":["https://aihot.news/items/cmpyc4uab03qgslaxgjm4awp6","https://claude.com/blog/how-anthropic-enables-self-service-data-analytics-with-claude"],"articles":[{"id":"cmpyc4uab03qgslaxgjm4awp6","title":"Anthropic 用 Claude 赋能自助数据分析","originalTitle":"","summary":"Anthropic 使用 Claude 自动化了 95% 的业务分析查询，整体准确率约 95%。其关键在于构建智能体分析栈（agentic analytics stack），通过数据基础层、维护验证流程和技能（skills）分别解决概念-实体歧义、数据过时和检索失败三大错误来源。相比编码场景，数据分析的难点在于将用户问题映射到正确的数据实体，而执行 SQL 反而是简单的。Anthropic 的数据科学团队因此得以专注于因果建模、预测和机器学习等战略工作。","reason":"","url":"https://aihot.news/items/cmpyc4uab03qgslaxgjm4awp6","originalUrl":"https://claude.com/blog/how-anthropic-enables-self-service-data-analytics-with-claude","publishedAt":"2026-06-04T00:00:00.452Z","sourcePublishedAt":null,"discoveredAt":null,"datePrecision":"report","sourceId":"aihot-1ckykuf","originalSourceName":"Claude：Blog（网页）","family":"anthropic","kind":"media","provider":"aihot","category":null,"sectionLabel":"技巧与观点","selected":false,"contentMode":"licensed-summary","contentType":"news","translationStatus":"original","evidenceRole":"discovery","rights":{"licenseId":"LicenseRef-AIHOT-Written-Permission","permissionId":"aihot-mojing-written-2026-11-04","provider":"aihot","scope":"text-summary","evidenceUrl":"https://aihot.news/items/cmpyc4uab03qgslaxgjm4awp6","licenseUrl":"https://aihot.news/terms","checkedAt":"2026-11-13T18:47:49.612Z","attribution":"导读来源：AIHOT；原报道权利归原作者","modified":"保留 AIHOT 原摘要，未二次改写"}}],"familyCount":0,"mergeReasons":[],"selectionReasons":[],"provider":"aihot","sourceStates":[{"id":"aihot-1ckykuf","name":"Claude：Blog（网页）","status"